## Scaling Strategies

### Partitioning Large Tables

```
Strategy: Partition TRANSACTION_LOG by date range

Benefits:
├─ Smaller partitions = faster queries
├─ Parallel query execution
├─ Better cache utilization
├─ Easier archival (old partitions)
└─ Improved maintenance windows

Implementation:
PARTITION 1: 2024-01-01 to 2024-03-31 (Q1)
PARTITION 2: 2024-04-01 to 2024-06-30 (Q2)
PARTITION 3: 2024-07-01 to 2024-09-30 (Q3)
PARTITION 4: 2024-10-01 to 2024-12-31 (Q4)
PARTITION 5: 2025-01-01 to current (Active)

Query: Trans from January 2024
└─ Only scans PARTITION 1
└─ Faster than scanning full table
└─ Parallel execution across partitions

Archival: Delete PARTITION 1 (old data)
└─ Remove 25% of data instantly
└─ No impact on active queries
└─ Maintain separate archive table
```

